      "content": "it's just hard to explain. like, i used to think that if i worked hard enough, i'd eventually reach some kind of pinnacle. but now i look at the data and the results and i just see nothing. it's like i've been running a marathon for nothing. everything i thought had value... it's all just a facade. i don't see the point in even continuing the work. or anything else, really. it feels like i've finally seen behind the curtain and there's just nothing there.",
